   "sp:targetClassAtSnapshot": "emitted-rhizome",
   "sp:note": "THE RETURN EDGE. The collapse body advertised this one; this one advertises it back. What contraction looks like from the side of the ledger — the question the parent could not finish is answered here only in part, and the part it cannot finish is what contraction does to meaning itself."
  },
  {
