   "sp:note": "A POEM IS SEMANTIC LABOUR THAT NOBODY PAID FOR, which is that body's §4.1 exactly — ontology engineering as semantic labor, the work the value is taken from. Pearl was printed in 2014 by a press the author runs, and the question of who bears the cost of making it is not answered here."
