   "sp:note": "THE KING OF MAY IS CLAIMED FOR THIS BOOK, read as a book against Howl and Other Poems as a book: the arrangement, a distinct I in each piece, an ecstatic democratic topology, pages 85 and 87 its sabbath. The claim is stated in EA-MANTLE-BEARING-01 (#1656) and judged in that body, round by round, with the transcripts; its pearl_arrangement table is keyed to this body's piece ids."
